{"unit_id":"tag:0228:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0003>。则存在合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0004>，它是<MATH_0005>的加细（refinement），使得每个<MATH_0006>都是仿射概形（affine scheme），且每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>都标准合成（syntomic），见《态射（Morphisms）》定义<REF_0001>。此外，可选择每个<MATH_0008>为某个<MATH_0009>中的仿射（affine）开集。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
