{"unit_id":"tag:0224:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n因此，如下定义相应的标准覆盖（coverings），它们覆盖仿射概形（affines）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0229:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准合成覆盖（standard syntomic covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，它覆盖<MATH_0002>，是族（family）<MATH_0003>，满足每个<MATH_0004>都仿射（affine），<MATH_0005>标准合成（syntomic），且<MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"standard syntomic covering","target_term":"标准合成覆盖"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"standard syntomic covering","target_term":"标准合成覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03X1:statement","translation":"<TEXTITOPEN_0001>大合成景（big syntomic site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是任意如下构造的景（site）<MATH_0001>，如《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中所述：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 选择任意概形（schemes）的集合（set）<MATH_0002>，以及任意合成（syntomic）覆盖（coverings）的集合（set）<MATH_0003>，它们是这些概形（schemes）之间的覆盖。\n<STRUCT_0003> 取底层范畴（underlying category）为任意范畴（category）<MATH_0004>，它按《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>的方法从集合（set）<MATH_0005>出发构造。\n<STRUCT_0004> 按《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>的方法选择任意覆盖（coverings）的集合（set），从范畴（category）<MATH_0006>、合成（syntomic）覆盖（coverings）的类（class），以及上面选定的集合（set）<MATH_0007>出发。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big syntomic site","target_term":"大合成景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"big syntomic site","target_term":"大合成景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆