{"unit_id":"tag:03X3:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是包含<MATH_0003>的大合成景（big syntomic site）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>大合成景（big syntomic site），它属于<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，记为<MATH_0005>，是景（site）<MATH_0006>，在《景（Sites）》第<REF_0001>节中引入。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>大仿射合成景（big affine syntomic site），它属于<MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，记为<MATH_0008>，是<MATH_0009>的满子范畴（full subcategory），其对象（objects）为仿射的（affine）<MATH_0010>。<MATH_0011>的覆盖（covering）是任意覆盖（covering）<MATH_0012>，它覆盖<MATH_0013>，且是标准合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big syntomic site","target_term":"大合成景"},{"source_term":"big syntomic site","target_term":"大合成景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"big affine syntomic site","target_term":"大仿射合成景"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"big syntomic site","target_term":"大合成景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"big affine syntomic site","target_term":"大仿射合成景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0224:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n接下来，验证大仿射（affine）景（site）定义的拓扑斯（topos）与大景（site）相同。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06VD:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是包含<MATH_0003>的大合成（syntomic）景（site）。函子（functor）<MATH_0004>特殊余连续（cocontinuous），并诱导拓扑斯（topoi）的等价（equivalence），从<MATH_0005>到<MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06VD:proof","translation":"特殊余连续（cocontinuous）函子（functor）的概念在《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中引入。因此，须验证《景（Sites）》引理<REF_0002>的假设 (1)–(5)。记包含函子（inclusion functor）为<MATH_0001>。余连续（cocontinuous）仅意味着：任意合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>仿射（affine），都可由标准合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering）加细，该覆盖覆盖<MATH_0004>。这是引理<REF_0003>的内容。因此 (1) 成立。<MATH_0005>连续（continuous），仅仅是因为标准合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering）是合成（syntomic）覆盖（covering）。因此 (2) 成立。(3)、(4) 立即由<MATH_0006>全忠实（fully faithful）这一事实得出。最后，条件 (5) 由每个概形（scheme）都有仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）这一事实得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"cocontinuous","target_term":"余连续","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"合成","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term"