{"unit_id":"tag:021L:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。我们希望定义 fppf 拓扑（topology）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>\n字母 fppf 代表“忠实平坦且有限呈示（fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat de pr<ACCENT_0002>sentation finie）”。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>，它在<MATH_0002>上概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上。按照一般原则，先引入 fppf 覆盖（covering）的概念。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat de pr<ACCENT_0002>sentation finie","target_term":"忠实平坦且有限呈示"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fid<ACCENT_0001>lement plat de pr<ACCENT_0002>sentation finie","target_term":"忠实平坦且有限呈示","context":"fppf 法语全称，待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:021M:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），它覆盖<MATH_0002><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是态射族（family of morphisms）<MATH_0003>，由概形（schemes）之间的态射组成，使得每个<MATH_0004>都平坦（flat）、局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation），且<MATH_0005>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
