{"unit_id":"tag:021O:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），它覆盖<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>有 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），且<MATH_0010>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:021O:proof","translation":"第一个断言是清楚的。第二个断言由以下事实得出：平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）仍平坦（flat）（见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>），且有限呈示（finite presentation）态射（morphisms）的复合（composition）仍有限呈示（finite presentation）（见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>）。第三个断言由以下事实得出：平坦（flat）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）仍平坦（flat）（见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>），且有限呈示（finite presentation）态射（morphism）的基变换（base change）仍有限呈示（finite presentation）（见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0004>）。此外，满射的（surjective）态射族（family of morphisms）的基变换（base change）仍满射（surjective）（证明略）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限呈示"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_t