{"unit_id":"tag:021P:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），它覆盖<MATH_0003>。则存在 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）<MATH_0004>，它是<MATH_0005>的加细（refinement），使得每个<MATH_0006>都是仿射概形（affine scheme）。此外，可选择每个<MATH_0007>为某个<MATH_0008>中的仿射（affine）开集。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
