{"unit_id":"tag:021R:statement","translation":"<TEXTITOPEN_0001>大 fppf 景（big fppf site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是任意如下构造的景（site）<MATH_0001>，如《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>中所述：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 选择任意概形（schemes）的集合（set）<MATH_0002>，以及任意 fppf 覆盖（coverings）的集合（set）<MATH_0003>，它们是这些概形（schemes）之间的覆盖。\n<STRUCT_0003> 取底层范畴（underlying category）为任意范畴（category）<MATH_0004>，它按《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>的方法从集合（set）<MATH_0005>出发构造。\n<STRUCT_0004> 按《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>的方法选择任意覆盖（coverings）的集合（set），从范畴（category）<MATH_0006>、fppf 覆盖（coverings）的类（class），以及上面选定的集合（set）<MATH_0007>出发。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"big fppf site","target_term":"大 fppf 景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"big fppf site","target_term":"大 fppf 景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"sour